"text": "If a pie chart's printed percentage labels are treated as the authoritative values for each source category, then the category with the highest printed percentage is the largest global energy consumption category.",
"component": "encoding/task relation",
"conditions": "The chart is a pie chart of global energy consumption by source, and the printed percentage labels are accepted as the category values."
},
{
"id": "r2",
"text": "If the task requires routing the largest global energy consumption category to priority source monitoring, then the public option that names that category for priority source monitoring is the supported action.",
