"conditions": "The largest category is identified, and a public option exists that routes that exact category to priority source monitoring."
},
{
"id": "r3",
"text": "If the printed percentage labels are not accepted as authoritative and the visible slice areas are used instead, then the category whose slice occupies the largest visible area is the largest global energy consumption category.",
"component": "encoding/task relation",
"conditions": "The chart is a pie chart, and visible slice area is used as the measure of category size rather than printed labels."
}
],
